  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。倾注爱心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于此模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Hide Experimental Warning（隐藏实验性警告），顾名思义，该模组会在创建或加载模组化世界时隐藏实验性设置警告。由于模组开发的性质，模组包中几乎总是包含实验性设置。众所周知，包含特性的世界可能会随时因更新而发生变化。此模组的作用是避免每次加载模组化世界时都弹出警告屏幕。有助于保持理智 :)<br><br>最初是为了在我的开发环境中隐藏警告而创建的，我认为将其作为功能发布给生产环境使用也无妨。此模组还会隐藏世界列表中黄色的实验性文本/三角形。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg&w=832\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum 的定制包中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>以下屏幕将被隐藏：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hide-experimental-warning/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hide-experimental-warning/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p>在世界列表中，黄色三角形将被隐藏：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hide-experimental-warning/c.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p>在较新版本中，“Experimental”文本也将被隐藏：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hide-experimental-warning/d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由在任何模组包中使用此模组，只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事项，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
